        "original_id": "5bd017b9-bd9b-54e8-a9e3-da3826be8698",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willard Mack, Wilbur Mack, Subhash Ghai\n- Roles: actor, film director, producer, screenwriter, dramatist\n- Works: Who's Your Neighbor?\n- Topics: Hindi cinema, screen dramas\n\nFacts:\n- Wilbur Mack was a fellow actor who was also born in 1873 and was not a relative of Willard Mack.\n- Subhash Ghai was born on 24 January 1945.\n- Subhash Ghai is an Indian film director, producer, and screenwriter known predominantly for his work in Hindi cinema.\n- Who's Your Neighbor? was a drama written by Willard Mack.\n- Who's Your Neighbor? was Willard Mack's first foray into screen dramas.",
